"""Published national planning ranges, kept separate from referral-provider pricing."""
import html

HG='https://homeguide.com/costs/'
# Each endpoint is a source-reported range. No local markup or promotional padding.
RANGES=[
 ('hvac','Furnace + central AC replacement','$5,000–$11,000','Installed system replacement; adding new ductwork is a different scope.','hvac-cost'),
 ('hvac','Single-zone ductless installation','$2,500–$6,000','One outdoor unit and one indoor unit, installed. Heating performance, equipment and site work need a specific assessment.','ductless-mini-split-ac-cost'),
 ('hvac','Three-zone ductless installation','$6,500–$11,000','Source example for three indoor zones, installed. It is not the price for every multi-zone layout.','ductless-mini-split-ac-cost'),
 ('hvac','AC tune-up','$70–$200','An air-conditioning maintenance visit; repairs, parts and refrigerant are separate.','ac-maintenance-tune-up-service-cost'),
 ('hvac','AC diagnostic visit','$75–$200','An assessment of an AC problem, before repairs. Ask what the visit includes.','ac-maintenance-tune-up-service-cost'),
 ('water-heaters','Standard tank water heater replacement','$600–$3,100','Source range for a standard 40–50 gallon tank, installed, before incentives. Fuel and connection changes affect scope.','water-heater-installation-cost'),
 ('water-heaters','Tankless water heater installation','$1,400–$5,600','Installed planning range, before incentives. Venting, gas, electrical or plumbing changes can add work.','water-heater-installation-cost'),
 ('water-heaters','Boiler replacement','$2,200–$10,000','Installed boiler replacement reference. Fuel, equipment and distribution work need a written proposal.','hvac-cost'),
 ('directory-prices','Small plumbing repair','$125–$350','Source examples include minor toilet, sink or faucet repairs. Ask about call-out minimums and parts.','plumber-cost'),
 ('directory-prices','Small electrical job','$141–$419','Source examples include fixture, outlet, switch or fan work. New wiring or panels are different projects.','electrical-work-pricing-guide'),
 ('directory-prices','Bedroom painting','$350–$850','Source bedroom example. Room size, preparation, coats, ceiling and trim scope must match.','cost-to-paint-interior-of-house'),
 ('directory-prices','Handyman labor','$50–$80 / hour','Source range for self-employed handyperson labor; materials, trip charges and minimums are additional.','handyman-prices'),
 ('directory-prices','General carpenter labor','$30–$100 / hour','Source range for standard self-employed carpenters. Specialist and master-carpenter work may cost more.','carpenter-hourly-rates'),
 ('directory-prices','Basic replacement window','$450–$1,500 / opening','Source range for installed single-hung windows in basic aluminum or vinyl frames; premium or custom openings differ.','window-replacement-cost'),
 ('directory-prices','Minor kitchen refresh','$10,000–$30,000','Source minor-remodel example, rather than a complete kitchen reconstruction or addition.','home-renovation-costs'),
 ('directory-prices','Small bathroom renovation','$3,000–$15,000+','Source small-bathroom example; moving fixtures, extensive tile or structural work changes scope.','home-renovation-costs'),
 ('directory-prices','New wood deck','$25–$50 / sq. ft.','Total installed source reference. Material, design, elevation, stairs and site work affect the proposal.','cost-to-build-a-deck'),
 ('directory-prices','Composite deck','$40–$80 / sq. ft.','Installed reference including the substructure. Compare the design, framing, railings and access.','composite-decking-prices'),
 ('auto-repair','Brake pad replacement','$335–$394','RepairPal’s general estimate; excludes taxes and fees and is not vehicle- or location-specific. Related repairs may be extra.','https://repairpal.com/estimator/brake-pad-replacement-cost'),
 ('auto-repair','Transmission fluid change','$294–$356','RepairPal’s general estimate; excludes taxes and fees. Confirm vehicle specifications and the precise service; this is not a transmission replacement.','https://repairpal.com/estimator/transmission-fluid-change-cost'),
 ('vehicle-wraps','Professional full-vehicle vinyl wrap','Around $2,000–$10,000+','Kelley Blue Book’s broad full-wrap reference. Vehicle size, film, coverage and preparation can make a large difference.','https://www.kbb.com/car-advice/how-much-cost-wrap-vehicle/'),
]


def guide_body():
    e=html.escape
    body='''<div class="buying-intro"><div class="eyebrow">THE WAZOOZIE COST CHECK</div><h1>What should<br><em>your project cost?</em></h1><p class="buying-lede">Get a sensible starting range. Then compare the actual work.</p><p>These are published <strong>U.S. planning ranges</strong>, not Middletown HVAC’s prices, a local bid survey or a promise of what your job should cost. Use them to prepare questions—not to label an unfamiliar quote fair or unfair.</p><p>Delco, Chester County and Main Line quotes may fall outside these ranges. Equipment, access, labor, permits and the condition of the property or vehicle all matter. A source’s low end is not a guaranteed available offer.</p></div><nav class="buying-jumps" aria-label="Price guide sections"><a href="#hvac">Heating &amp; cooling</a><a href="#water-heaters">Hot water &amp; boilers</a><a href="#directory-prices">Home projects</a><a href="#auto-repair">Auto care</a><a href="#vehicle-wraps">Vehicle wraps</a><a href="#real-estate">Real estate</a><a href="#method">Sources &amp; method</a></nav>'''
    headings=[('hvac','HEATING & COOLING','Comfort has a scope.'),('water-heaters','HOT WATER & BOILERS','Price the complete installation.'),('directory-prices','AROUND THE HOUSE','From small fixes to bigger ideas.'),('auto-repair','THE CAR YOU COUNT ON','Start with the vehicle and the finding.'),('vehicle-wraps','A DIFFERENT KIND OF CURB APPEAL','Coverage changes the cost.')]
    for group,kicker,title in headings:
        body+='<section id="'+group+'" class="buying-section"><div class="eyebrow">'+e(kicker)+'</div><h2>'+e(title)+'</h2><div class="price-grid">'
        for category,label,value,scope,source in RANGES:
            if category!=group:continue
            url=source if source.startswith('https://') else HG+source
            publisher='HomeGuide' if url.startswith(HG) else 'RepairPal' if 'repairpal.com' in url else 'Kelley Blue Book'
            body+='<article class="price-card" data-cost-category="'+group+'"><p class="eyebrow">'+e(label)+'</p><h3>'+e(value)+'</h3><span class="price-type">NATIONAL PLANNING REFERENCE</span><p>'+e(scope)+'</p><a href="'+url+'">Source: '+publisher+' ↗</a><small>Source checked November 6, 2026 · actual quotes vary</small></article>'
        body+='</div>'
        if group=='hvac':
            body+='''<aside class="range-next-step"><h3>Turn the general range into your own starting point.</h3><p>Middletown HVAC’s tools provide business-specific planning prices for the equipment and options you select. Compare the same system and complete installation scope.</p><a class="btn primary" href="https://www.mtownhvac.com/install-estimate/?utm_source=wazoozie&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cost-guide">Explore the HVAC install estimator ↗</a><p><a href="https://www.mtownhvac.com/ductless-estimator/?utm_source=wazoozie&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cost-guide">Plan a ductless project ↗</a> · <a href="/guides/compare-hvac-estimates/">Compare two HVAC scopes →</a></p></aside>'''
        else:
            destination='/auto-mechanics/' if group=='auto-repair' else '/vehicle-wraps/' if group=='vehicle-wraps' else '/local-help/'
            body+='<p><a href="'+destination+'">Find the right local contact →</a> · <a href="/compare/">Compare the written scope →</a></p>'
        body+='</section>'
    body+='''<section id="real-estate" class="buying-section"><div class="eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER</div><h2>Agree on the service. Negotiate the fee.</h2><p>There is no universal “should cost” commission here. NAR’s buyer-agreement guidance states that compensation and agreement terms are negotiable. Ask each professional for the services, compensation, duration and obligations in writing.</p><p>A percentage, flat fee or another agreed structure needs to be evaluated with the service it buys. Confirm who pays, when payment is due and what happens if the transaction does not close.</p><p><a href="https://www.nar.realtor/the-facts/consumer-guide-to-written-buyer-agreements">Source: NAR consumer guidance ↗</a> · <a href="/real-estate-agents/">Meet local real estate professionals →</a></p></section><section class="buying-section buying-note"><h2>Below the range? Above it? Ask the next question.</h2><p>For a low quote, check the equipment or materials, preparation, exclusions and follow-up terms. For a high quote, ask which requirements, site conditions or options account for the difference. Price alone does not prove good value or poor conduct.</p><p>A standard replacement and a complex retrofit are different projects. Ask for the same scope from more than one business before drawing a conclusion.</p><a href="/before-you-say-yes/">Bring sharper questions to the conversation →</a></section><section id="method" class="buying-section buying-note"><h2>Sources beside the numbers.</h2><p>Checked November 6, 2026. Range endpoints match the selected publishers’ stated figures for the scopes described. HomeGuide provides national planning references, RepairPal provides general automotive estimates, and Kelley Blue Book provides a broad professional-wrap reference. Source publication dates vary; the check date is not a new local survey.</p><p>Some references include installation; hourly rates and automotive estimates have different exclusions. Read each card and its linked source. These are not guaranteed quotes, required rates or evidence that a higher or lower proposal is wrong.</p><p>Wazoozie is operated by Bryan Cordy, owner of Middletown HVAC. Estimator links are referrals to that business. The ranges are editorial context, not independent audits of any listed business.</p><p><a href="/project-budget/">Build a project budget →</a> · <a href="/compare/">Compare written estimates →</a> · <a href="/our-standards/">Read our standards →</a></p></section>'''
    return body
